            <ArticleTitle>Transthecal digital block: digital anaesthesia through the sheath of the flexor tendon.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>889</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied the effectiveness of a local injection of 1 ml of 2% mepivacaine into the sheath of the flexor tendon in 64 fingers and found it to be a safe procedure giving satisfactory anaesthesia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
